"following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/spolitov/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/spolitov/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/spolitov/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/spolitov/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/spolitov/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/spolitov/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/spolitov/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/spolitov/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}],"milestone":null,"comments":4,"created_at":"2023-07-24T10:44:39Z","updated_at":"2024-06-28T10:31:09Z","closed_at":"2023-11-11T00:23:36Z","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"Jira Link: [DB-7371](https://yugabyte.atlassian.net/browse/DB-7371)\r\n### Description\r\n\r\n**Note:**\r\n\r\n- Currently I am exploring the reproducibility and The build from where we are seeing the issue\r\n- This is seen with the automation- TestYSQLTSPCMVAndBR\r\n\r\n**Steps:**\r\n\r\n1. Create two Universes (U1 & U2) with splitting enabled, with RPC(algo=1) and PC.\r\n           Perform below ops on U1\r\n```\r\nMASTER_FLAGS[\"ysql_enable_packed_row\"] = \"true\"\r\n            MASTER_FLAGS[\"ysql_enable_packed_row_for_colocated_table\"] = \"true\"\r\n            TSERVER_FLAGS[\"ysql_enable_packed_row\"] = \"true\"\r\n            TSERVER_FLAGS[\"ysql_enable_packed_row_for_colocated_table\"] = \"true\"\r\n```\r\n\r\n  2. Create colocation database with some colocated and some colocated opt out tables\r\n      and non colocated database with some tables (HASH and RANGE Shard Tables)\r\n  3. Create Unique, Secondary and Partial indexes for some tables.\r\n  4. Create Materialized Views for some tables\r\n  5. Load some data and validate data in tables and indexes and refresh Materialized Views\r\n     and validate data\r\n  6. Create 2 more tables(1 HASH and 1 RANGE) and Materialized Views and indexes and\r\n     load data using COPY FROM cmd(50K rows/ table) to both tables\r\n  7. Collect data points and take backup(B1)\r\n  8. Do some DDLs and DMLS(Add a column, update a column name and Insert, delete and updates)\r\n     and validate data and tablets\r\n  9. Take backup(b2)\r\n  10. Drop database and restore B1 and validate data and tablets\r\n  11. Restore B2 into that U2\r\n  12. Validate data and tablets at both universes\r\n        \r\n**Issue**:\r\nOn executing a `select * on one of the non_colocated_db` tables in the source universe, this error is returned.  this error does not go away-\r\n  ```\r\n  non_colocated_db=# select count(*) from non_colocated_employees;\r\n  ERROR:  Schema packing not found: 7, available_versions: [9, 0]\r\n  ```\r\n\r\nlogs: https://drive.google.com/file/d/1Ms1YKeBKh1uvjUJt3LYMBIGC5VXwokhD/view?usp=sharing\r\ncc: @kripasreenivasan @zlareb1-yb \r\n\r\n### Warning: Please confirm that this issue does not contain any sensitive information\r\n\r\n- [X] I confirm this issue does not contain any sensitive information.\r\n\r\n[DB-7371]: https://yugabyte.atlassian.net/browse/DB-7371?atlOrigin=eyJpIjoiNWRkNTljNzYxNjVmNDY3MDlhMDU5Y2ZhYzA5YTRkZjUiLCJwIjoiZ2l0aHViLWNvbS1KU1cifQ","closed_by":{"login":"rthallamko3","id":17170123,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3MTcwMTIz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17170123?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rthallamko3","html_url":"https://github.com/rthallamko3","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rthallamko3/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rthallamko3/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rthallamko3/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rthalla